{"id":"n23961-2-2","stage":3,"title":"과연 · 果真","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23961-2-2-1","ko":"무조건 내가 시키는 대로만 하세요.","zh":"你绝对要按我说的去做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무조건","meaning":"绝对，无条件地","explanation":"무조건：绝对，无条件地","readings":[{"term":"무조건","audio":"/audio/53327615f36878a978f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55134","senseId":"1","lemma":"무조건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시키는","meaning":"让，叫","explanation":"시키다：让，叫；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"1","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대로만","meaning":"随","explanation":"대로：随；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"대로","audio":"/audio/aa5467e15c67a6b0bb65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48415","senseId":"1","lemma":"대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하세요.","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"53327615f36878a9","term":"무조건","zh":"绝对，无条件地","audio":"/audio/53327615f36878a978f3.mp3","entryId":"55134","definition":"什么都不考虑，也没有特别的理由。","pronunciation":["무조껀"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"让，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"使做某事或某种行为。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"aa5467e15c67a6b0","term":"대로","zh":"随","audio":"/audio/aa5467e15c67a6b0bb65.mp3","entryId":"48415","definition":"像某个状态或情况。","pronunciation":["대로"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18398c4f1344c8a24100.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23961-2-2-2","ko":"그런데 이 방법이 과연 효과가 있을지 모르겠네요.","zh":"不过，不确定这个方法到底有没有效果呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방법이","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과연","meaning":"果真，到底","explanation":"과연：果真，到底","readings":[{"term":"과연","audio":"/audio/4f704f5c765f00ac12e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23961","senseId":"2","lemma":"과연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"효과가","meaning":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","explanation":"효과：效果，功效，效力，成效，作用；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"효과","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62405","senseId":"1","lemma":"효과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을지","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠네요.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"4f704f5c765f00ac","term":"과연","zh":"果真，到底","audio":"/audio/4f704f5c765f00ac12e4.mp3","entryId":"23961","definition":"结果究竟(怎样)。","pronunciation":["과연"]},{"id":"377d1a0f2e6c609d","term":"효과","zh":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3","entryId":"62405","definition":"做某事所获得的好的结果。","pronunciation":["효ː과","효ː꽈"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc94055ba6b623f76d14.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23961","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.6997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不过，不确定这个方法到底有没有效果呢。","你绝对要按我说的去做。","你喜欢哪位歌手呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你绝对要按我说的去做。","你喜欢哪位歌手呢？","不过，不确定这个方法到底有没有效果呢。"],"answer":2}]}
